im "Alice has to pay $3,538 in taxes for the year 2017 under section 1(c)(iii)" is FALSE because:\n    - Alice\'s tax is determined under 1(c)(ii), not 1(c)(iii)\n    - 1(c)(iii) only applies to taxable income over $53,500\n\n## Answer\nAnswer: Contradiction\nEOF\n'] min_timeout_sec: 0.5 max_timeout_sec: 180.0
