ers\' AGI ($83,092) does not exceed $300,000, so no phaseout applies.\n\n6. **Taxable Income**: $83,092 - $6,000 (standard deduction) - $6,000 (exemptions) = $71,092.\n\n7. **Tax Calculation**: Under §1(a)(ii), for taxable income over $36,900 but not over $89,150:\n   Tax = $5,535 + 28% × ($71,092 - $36,900)\n   Tax = $5,535 + 0.28 × $34,192\n   Tax = $5,535 + $9,573.76\n   Tax = $15,108.76\n\n8. **Rounding**: The tax rounds to $15,109.\n\n## Answer\nAnswer: 15109\nEOF\n'] min_timeout_sec: 0.5 max_timeout_sec: 180.0
