hat Bob is a brother or sister of Alice\'s father or mother.\n\n7. The relationship described in 152(d)(2)(F) does not apply because Bob is not a brother or sister of Alice\'s parent.\n\n## Answer\nAnswer: Contradiction\nEOF\n'] min_timeout_sec: 0.5 max_timeout_sec: 180.0
